{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952540/extras/a2be69fd14e5e1bc92400c54c160c1fb.avif?t=1774563295\" alt=\"Is it a bird? A plane? It&#039;s a bird!! (A really really cute on thought)  Immortalize the chunkiest, cutest birds you\u2019ve ever seen with Birdseed\u2019s in-game camera, meant to feel just like you\u2019re holding the real thing. Aim, shoot, print and record the birds you\u2019ve found in your Journal and work on getting that 3 star shot!\" width=638 height=250 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952540/extras/c9cc332832eda70f4f5bb612d8d5b50d.poster.avif?t=1774563295\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=616 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952540/extras/c9cc332832eda70f4f5bb612d8d5b50d.webm?t=1774563295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952540/extras/c9cc332832eda70f4f5bb612d8d5b50d.mp4?t=1774563295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952540/extras/7a9b1b12170017d4e193ee9181fab787.avif?t=1774563295\" alt=\"Get cozy with nature! Enjoy the immersive sounds of the forest. The birds and bird sounds of Birdseed are all based on their real life counterparts. Step into a cozy forest setting and let the nature sounds wrap you up in a warm hug!\" width=640 height=227 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952540/extras/2dc26e7070d5b4f509020b5e94509145.poster.avif?t=1774563295\" aria-hidden=\