store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952540/extras/3a055b4f1114a14f6e9d498cab501840.avif?t=1774563295\" alt=\" Cozy social multiplayer  Play online with a friend, share photos, and enjoy nature together.  Take on daily quests \u2028Check your Journal every day for new missions to embark on.  Get the perfect shot \u2028Track your shots in your Journal and aim for higher star ratings.  Immerse yourself in nature \u2028Enjoy spatial audio design that transports you into the forest, \u2028with unique bird calls for each bird you spot.\u2028 Suitable for seated play \u2028Even this VR experience is cozy! No need to move around - get \u2028the perfect shot even from the comfort of your couch.\" width=616 height=342 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952540?t=1774563295","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952540?t=1774563295","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952540/c4ba3e74abbff371aceb594190ed3e1f5509380d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774563295","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952540/c4ba3e74abbff371aceb594190ed3e1f5509380d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774563295","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4029460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952540/extras/a2be69fd14e5e1bc92400c54c160c1fb.avif?t=1774563295\" alt=\"Is it a bird? A plane? It&#039;s a bird!! (A really really cute on t